    "body": "This needs some kind of note explaining the setup. This also seems like a layering violation. Is this really supposed to happen for all events or just certain UI events? Is it supposed to happen for synthetic events or just events dispatched by the user agent?\r\n\r\n(If you rebase and force push the CI error will go away.)",
